{
  "id": "868c2b89f39a89ed82cec085",
  "title": "Android 中的 Hardware Layer 详解",
  "summary": "技术复核 · 2026-10-13。 本文 2019 年的截图和日志保留为历史案例，不代表当前设备的性能。源码以 AOSP android-9.0.0_r1 、 android-1",
  "content": "<blockquote><p><strong>技术复核 · 2026-10-13。</strong> 本文 2019 年的截图和日志保留为历史案例，不代表当前设备的性能。源码以 AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code>、<code>android-16.0.0_r1</code> 为核对基线。缓存原理仍有参考价值；原文关于逐帧重新分配、固定性能排序、用 gfxinfo 推断 CPU 负载的说法已修正。案例六与案例一整段日志重复，测量来源尚不能确认。</p></blockquote><h1><a title=\"硬件加速与软件加速\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>硬件加速与软件加速</h1><p>很多人会把 Android 中的硬件加速和 Hardware Layer 搞混，以为启用了硬件加速，就是启用了 Hardware Layer。所以在说 Hardware Layer 之前，我们先说一下硬件加速。</p><p>原文推荐的两篇文章保留为历史阅读：<a href=\"https://www.mtyun.com/library/hardware-accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 硬件加速原理与实现简介</a>、<a href=\"https://juejin.im/post/5a1f7b3e6fb9a0451b0451bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">理解 Android 硬件加速的小白文</a>。API 支持范围以 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/graphics/hardware-accel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 官方文档</a> 为准。</p><p>对 View 绘制来说，软件路径主要由 CPU 栅格化，硬件加速路径由 HWUI 使用 GPU 完成相应绘制；CPU 仍要处理布局、记录绘制命令和提交工作。Skia 也支持 GPU 后端，不能把“用了 Skia”直接等同于软件渲染。</p><p>View 硬件加速从 Android 3.0（API 11）引入，对 targetSdkVersion ≥ 14 的应用默认开启；应用、Activity、Window 的配置以及 View 的软件 layer 会影响实际路径。原理和代码可以顺着上面的文章继续看，这里我想换个角度，用当时的 Systrace 带大家看看两种绘制路径的差别。</p><h2><a title=\"硬件加速 App 的表现\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>硬件加速 App 的表现</h2><p>以滑动桌面为例。在 Android 5.0（API 21）以后的典型 HWUI 路径中，主线程和 RenderThread 配合准备一帧。</p><p><img></p><p>放大来看，主线程处理输入、动画以及按需执行的 traversal，RenderThread 处理后续绘制工作。图中旧注释把部分 measure/layout 工作归入“Draw”，应按具体 slice 和调用链区分。</p><p><img></p><p>这些是 CPU 线程上的时间片。不能把 RenderThread 的执行时长当成 GPU 执行时长，也不能把提交完成或 eglSwapBuffers 返回当成实际屏幕呈现；主线程何时解除等待也取决于渲染路径。</p><h2><a title=\"软件加速 App 的表现\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>软件加速 App 的表现</h2><p>软件绘制这边，我当时找了云闪付作对照。那次滑动起来一卡一卡的，非常难受。截图里没有显示 RenderThread 工作，主线程中能看到绘制和 buildDrawingCache；这不能证明整个进程始终不存在 RenderThread，也不能推广为该 App 所有版本的配置。<a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%B8%B2%E6%9F%93%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B-%E4%BA%91%E9%97%AA%E4%BB%98.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><p>放大后的选中片段约为 20.878 ms，显示这段绘制较长；仅凭截图不能断言每一帧都超时。即使 App 在 CPU 上绘制窗口内容，后续系统合成仍可能使用 GPU 或硬件合成器。</p><p><img></p><h2><a title=\"总结\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结</h2><ol><li>硬件加速改变 View 的绘制路径，不会让 CPU 工作消失；是否看到 RenderThread 不能单独作为整个 App 的开关判据。</li><li>软件 View、软件窗口和硬件加速窗口可以共存，App 绘制与系统合成也要分开看。</li><li>硬件加速通常适合现代 View 界面，但收益取决于工作量、资源和设备，不能仅凭两张图断言始终更快。</li><li>不支持的绘制操作要按 Android API 版本检查；必要时对局部 View 使用软件 layer，而不是无条件关闭整个应用的硬件加速。</li></ol><h1><a title=\"Software Layer VS Hardware Layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Software Layer VS Hardware Layer</h1><p>说完硬件渲染，再看 View 的 Software Layer 和 Hardware Layer。这里的 layer 是 View 的离屏像素缓存，不是 SurfaceFlinger 的合成 layer，也不等于整个窗口的硬件加速开关。</p><p>一个 View 的 layerType 有三种状态：</p><ol><li><code>LAYER_TYPE_NONE</code>：不额外建立显式的 View 像素 layer。</li><li><code>LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE</code>：将 View 内容用软件路径绘制到 Bitmap；所在窗口开启硬件加速时仍可使用。</li><li><code>LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE</code>：在硬件加速的 View 层级中使用 GPU 离屏 layer；未开启硬件加速时按软件 layer 处理。</li></ol><h2><a title=\"LAYER_TYPE_NONE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>LAYER_TYPE_NONE</h2><p>这是默认值。它不等于关闭硬件加速，也不等于每次都从零绘制：硬件路径仍可复用 RenderNode/display list 中记录的绘制命令。</p><h2><a title=\"LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE</h2><p>Software Layer 是怎么用软件实现这个 layer 的呢？简单说，就是把 View 的内容缓存到 Bitmap。下面是 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/View.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 View.java</a> 的分配片段，变量由 framework 上下文提供，不是独立示例：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>bitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(mResources.getDisplayMetrics(),</span><br><span>        width, height, quality);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>内容失效时需要重绘 Bitmap；原 Bitmap 存在且尺寸不变时可复用，不能把每次重绘写成每次销毁和重新分配。</p><h4><a title=\"Software layer 的作用如下\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Software layer 的作用如下</h4><ol><li>软件绘制时，可将 View 及其子 View 作为一组应用透明度、颜色过滤或混合效果。</li><li>硬件绘制时，可承接该版本硬件路径不支持的局部操作；稳定内容也可能通过缓存减少重复绘制。</li><li>内容频繁更新时，要承担软件重绘及硬件路径中的纹理上传成本，不宜把它当作通用动画优化。</li></ol><h2><a title=\"LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE</h2><p>Hardware Layer 将 View 内容绘制到 GPU 离屏资源，再用于窗口绘制。OpenGL 后端中可以用 FBO 理解它，但不能把所有 Android 版本和 Skia GL/Vulkan 后端都写成同一个 FBO 实现。它仍依赖当前 View 层级的硬件加速状态；关闭时退化为软件 layer。</p><h3><a title=\"Hardware layer 的作用：\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Hardware layer 的作用：</h3><p>Hardware Layer 可以给一组内容应用混合效果，也可能减少稳定复杂 View 在 translation、alpha、scale、rotation 动画中的重复绘制。缓存还会影响旋转或 3D 变换时的裁剪与采样，但不保证所有缩放都更清晰或更快。</p><p>动画期间临时使用 layer，结束后恢复原来的类型。下面的示例假定这段代码独占该 View 的 layerType，且在 UI 线程执行：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>ObjectAnimator</span> <span>anim</span> <span>=</span> ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(view, <span>&quot;rotationY&quot;</span>, <span>180f</span>);</span><br><span>anim.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>private</span> <span>int</span> previousLayerType;</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animation)</span> {</span><br><span>        previousLayerType = view.getLayerType();</span><br><span>        view.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE, <span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animation)</span> {</span><br><span>        view.setLayerType(previousLayerType, <span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span>anim.start();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>ObjectAnimator 取消时也会走结束回调。不要让多个动画同时管理同一个 View 的 layerType。Android API 16 起也可以使用 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/ViewPropertyAnimator#withLayer()\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">withLayer()</a>，由 ViewPropertyAnimator 在结束或取消后恢复调用时的类型：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>view.animate().rotationY(<span>180f</span>).withLayer().start();</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>只改变变换属性时，内容缓存可能复用；修改文本、增删子 View 或其他内容失效会要求重绘。是否重新分配离屏资源还要看尺寸、资源状态和具体后端，不能一概称为“FBO 被销毁”。</p><h2><a title=\"总结\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结</h2><ol><li>Software Layer 与 Hardware Layer 是不同的像素缓存路径；按绘制支持范围和实际开销选择。</li><li>对稳定复杂内容的属性动画，Hardware Layer 可能有收益，仍需与默认 <code>NONE</code> 比较。</li><li>动画结束后恢复原类型，避免长期持有不需要的 layer。图形资源可能延后释放或被底层复用，不保证调用后进程内存立即下降。</li></ol><h1><a title=\"不正确使用 LayerType 导致的性能问题案例\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>不正确使用 LayerType 导致的性能问题案例</h1><h2><a title=\"不正确使用 Software layer 引起的性能问题\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>不正确使用 Software layer 引起的性能问题</h2><p>下面是微信朋友圈大图滑动的历史案例。主线程反复执行 <code>buildDrawingCache/SW</code>，说明软件缓存绘制在重复发生，可以继续追查内容更新与 invalidate 来源。它本身不能证明每次都分配新 Bitmap。<a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/%E4%B8%8D%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8SoftwareLayer%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B-%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%BB%91%E5%8A%A8%E5%8D%A1%E9%A1%BF.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><p>我当时滑这张朋友圈大图，顿挫感很明显。放大 Trace 后能看到绘制片段较长，值得检查是否可以避免重复软件绘制；还需要结合调度状态和其他工作确认卡顿原因。</p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"代码流程\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码流程</h3><p>这里要区分 <code>buildLayer()</code> 的两条分支。以下摘自 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/View.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 View.java</a>：只有 <code>LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE</code> 走 <code>buildDrawingCache → buildDrawingCacheImpl</code>，硬件分支交给 ThreadedRenderer。它们是 framework 片段，依赖类内字段。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>buildLayer</span><span>()</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (mLayerType == LAYER_TYPE_NONE) <span>return</span>;</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>final</span> <span>AttachInfo</span> <span>attachInfo</span> <span>=</span> mAttachInfo;</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (attachInfo == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>throw</span> <span>new</span> <span>IllegalStateException</span>(<span>&quot;This view must be attached to a window first&quot;</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (getWidth() == <span>0</span> || getHeight() == <span>0</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>switch</span> (mLayerType) {</span><br><span>        <span>case</span> LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE:</span><br><span>            updateDisplayListIfDirty();</span><br><span>            <span>if</span> (attachInfo.mThreadedRenderer != <span>null</span> &amp;&amp; mRenderNode.isValid()) {</span><br><span>                attachInfo.mThreadedRenderer.buildLayer(mRenderNode);</span><br><span>            }</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>        <span>case</span> LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE:</span><br><span>            buildDrawingCache(<span>true</span>);</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>buildDrawingCache</span><span>(<span>boolean</span> autoScale)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> ((mPrivateFlags &amp; PFLAG_DRAWING_CACHE_VALID) == <span>0</span> || (autoScale ?</span><br><span>            mDrawingCache == <span>null</span> : mUnscaledDrawingCache == <span>null</span>)) {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (Trace.isTagEnabled(Trace.TRACE_TAG_VIEW)) {</span><br><span>            Trace.traceBegin(Trace.TRACE_TAG_VIEW,</span><br><span>                    <span>&quot;buildDrawingCache/SW Layer for &quot;</span> + getClass().getSimpleName());</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        <span>try</span> {</span><br><span>            buildDrawingCacheImpl(autoScale);</span><br><span>        } <span>finally</span> {</span><br><span>            Trace.traceEnd(Trace.TRACE_TAG_VIEW);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Trace 包围的是缓存绘制调用，不是专门的分配事件。<code>buildDrawingCacheImpl</code> 会在 Bitmap 不存在或尺寸不匹配时分配；尺寸匹配时可以清理后重绘到已有 Bitmap。旧 drawing-cache API 在 API 28 已弃用，不建议应用直接调用这些方法作为现代优化入口。</p><h2><a title=\"不正确使用 Hardware layer 引起的性能问题\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>不正确使用 Hardware layer 引起的性能问题</h2><p>下面是桌面打开文件夹的历史案例，多个图标建立了 Hardware Layer，RenderThread 中能看到重复的 layer 绘制工作。缓存内容频繁变化时，额外离屏绘制可能抵消缓存收益；仅凭这些 slice 不能断言每一帧都销毁、重新分配 buffer。<a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/%E4%B8%8D%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8HardwareLayer%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B-%E6%A1%8C%E9%9D%A2%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B9%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><p>放大图中选中区间约 21.68 ms，其中一个 ShortcutIcon 的 layer 绘制约 4.783 ms。应区分单个 slice、整帧与 GPU 执行时间。</p><p><img></p><p>例如 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/libs/hwui/pipeline/skia/SkiaPipeline.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 SkiaPipeline::createOrUpdateLayer</a> 会检查 layer 是否存在、尺寸是否变化，允许复用现有资源；内容重绘与资源分配不是同一件事。</p><h2><a title=\"Debug 工具\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Debug 工具</h2><p>部分历史系统的开发者选项提供“显示硬件层更新（Show hardware layers updates）”。入口和可用性因版本、厂商而异，不一定在“辅助功能”下面。</p><p>它标记更新的硬件 layer 区域，不是必然让整个界面变绿。稳定内容的变换动画通常希望初始化后复用；持续高亮说明要检查更新来源，但动态内容需要更新本来就是正常行为。没有高亮也不能单独证明缓存行为或性能。结合 Trace 中的 layer 绘制、尺寸和帧时序一起判断。</p><h2><a title=\"总结\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结</h2><ol><li>先看内容是否稳定、绘制是否足够复杂，再决定是否给属性动画加 Hardware Layer。</li><li>不要“能加就加”。建立缓存、占用内存、绘制离屏内容再合成到窗口都有成本。</li><li>Alpha 是否需要额外离屏工作与重叠内容、渲染路径等有关；不能把所有 setAlpha 或透明度动画都说成必然创建同一种 buffer。</li><li>内容 invalidate 可能导致重绘，但不等于必然重新分配整块资源。频繁变化时，应比较 <code>NONE</code> 与 layer 路径，而不是预设固定优劣。</li><li>临时修改 layerType 后恢复原值；软件 layer 用于有明确兼容需求或收益的局部场景。</li></ol><h1><a title=\"LayerType 对动画性能的影响示例\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>LayerType 对动画性能的影响示例</h1><h2><a title=\"示例\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>示例</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><p>为了把前面讨论的情况放在一起比较，我写了个很小的例子，只用两个 TextView：一个开始动画，一个执行 TRANSLATION_X、ALPHA、TRANSLATION_Y、SCALE_X、SCALE_Y。Start/End 监听器选择 layer，Update 监听器控制是否修改文本。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">示例项目</a>的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/app/src/main/java/com/example/hardwarelayertest/MainActivity.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">固定源码快照</a>（<code>0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3</code>）在开始回调中连续设置 HARDWARE、SOFTWARE，最终生效的是 SOFTWARE，且文本更新已开启。直接运行这个快照不能得到六组独立对照。该工程配置为 compile/target SDK 29、min SDK 26，是历史工程。</p><p>下面保留原实验的 500 ms、150 px 平移、alpha 到 0、scaleX/scaleY 到 <strong>150 倍</strong>；这些不是常规 UI 参数。动态案例逐帧追加文本，会同时引入字符串分配、文本测量和布局变化，不能只归因于 layer。</p><p>代码是修正过语法的展示片段，不代表重新测得下方日志。每次只安装一个案例的一组监听器，替换下方默认监听器，不要把六组叠加；使用新的 AnimatorSet，并在开始前将 TextView 的 layer 设为 NONE，恢复文本、计数器、alpha=1、scaleX/scaleY=1、translationX/Y=0，等待布局完成，避免动画重入。只有在这个明确初始条件下，案例结束设回 NONE 才成立。项目字段、控件初始化和 imports 仍需来自完整工程。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>  <span>//设置动画</span></span><br><span>  animatorSet = <span>new</span> <span>AnimatorSet</span>();</span><br><span>  objectAnimator1 = ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(animationText, View.TRANSLATION_X,<span>150</span>);</span><br><span>  objectAnimator2 = ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(animationText, View.ALPHA,<span>0</span>);</span><br><span>  objectAnimator3 = ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(animationText, View.TRANSLATION_Y,<span>150</span>);</span><br><span>  objectAnimator4 = ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(animationText, View.SCALE_X,<span>150</span>);</span><br><span>  objectAnimator5 = ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(animationText, View.SCALE_Y,<span>150</span>);</span><br><span>animatorSet.playTogether(objectAnimator1,objectAnimator2,objectAnimator3,objectAnimator4,objectAnimator5);</span><br><span>  animatorSet.setDuration(<span>500</span>);</span><br><span></span><br><span>  <span>//添加动画监听器</span></span><br><span>  objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>      <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>      <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>          animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>          <span>// animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE,null);</span></span><br><span>      }</span><br><span></span><br><span>      <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>      <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>          animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_NONE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>      }</span><br><span>  });</span><br><span></span><br><span>  objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>      <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>      <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>          <span>// animationText.setText(String.format(&quot;%s%d&quot;, animationText.getText().toString(), i));</span></span><br><span>          <span>// i ++ ;</span></span><br><span>      }</span><br><span>  });</span><br><span>  <span>//开始动画</span></span><br><span>  startText.setOnClickListener(<span>new</span> <span>View</span>.OnClickListener() {</span><br><span>      <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>      <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onClick</span><span>(View view)</span> {</span><br><span>          animatorSet.start();</span><br><span>      }</span><br><span>  });</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"统计工具:GFXInfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>统计工具:GFXInfo</h3><p>当时除了看 Systrace，我还用了 <code>adb shell dumpsys gfxinfo &lt;包名&gt;</code> 记录 HWUI 帧统计。下面是历史输出示意，图片里的旧解释需要按以下规则阅读：</p><p><img></p><ol><li>Janky frames 按对应系统的帧间隔/截止时间规则统计，不是跨版本固定的“超过 16 ms”；直方图和 percentile 是分桶统计，99th percentile 不是精确最大值。</li><li>High input latency 不是 CPU 负载，也不等于输入回调执行时长。<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/libs/hwui/JankTracker.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 JankTracker</a> 中存在三缓冲延后截止时间的分支；它可记录 high input latency 而不记录 missed deadline。各原因计数也不能简单相加当作 janky 总数。</li><li><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/libs/hwui/JankTracker.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 16 JankTracker</a> 同时保留 legacy 与更新的 deadline 统计路径。比较新设备时要保存系统版本、刷新率、统计区间和原始输出；gfxinfo 不覆盖完整输入到屏幕延迟。</li><li>六组旧日志每组只有 29–31 帧，设备、系统与采集重置条件记录不足。案例一和六连直方图都完全相同，不能当作已确认的独立测量。本次未在设备重跑，也未补造数据。</li></ol><h2><a title=\"案例一：Normal Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例一：Normal Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>// 不修改 layerType，也不更新文本。</span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h3><p>截图中有黄色帧标记，RenderThread 的 flush commands 片段较长；该片段仍是 CPU 侧工作或等待，不能直接读作 GPU 耗时。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/Normal_Layer.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 14/30（46.67%），99th percentile 为 32 ms，High input latency 为 30。这是当次样本统计，不能据此判断主线程 CPU 负载。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 30</span><br><span>Janky frames: 14 (46.67%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 16ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 29ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 32ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 32ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 30</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 0</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=0 6ms=0 7ms=0 8ms=0 9ms=0 10ms=2 11ms=2 12ms=5 13ms=1 14ms=2 15ms=1 16ms=3 17ms=2 18ms=0 19ms=0 20ms=0 21ms=1 22ms=1 23ms=1 24ms=1 25ms=2 26ms=2 27ms=0 28ms=1 29ms=1 30ms=0 31ms=0 32ms=2 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"案例二：Software Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例二：Software Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span> objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_NONE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>        i = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h3><p>截图中先出现 buildDrawingCache/SW，后续展示的变换帧未见同样的缓存绘制，符合复用稳定内容的情况。绿色帧标记不能替代完整的帧时序和重复实验。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/Software_Layer.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 1/31（3.23%），99th percentile 为 16 ms，High input latency 为 0。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 31</span><br><span>Janky frames: 1 (3.23%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 9ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 12ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 16ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 16ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 1</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 1</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=2 6ms=2 7ms=4 8ms=3 9ms=5 10ms=11 11ms=0 12ms=1 13ms=0 14ms=1 15ms=0 16ms=2 17ms=0 18ms=0 19ms=0 20ms=0 21ms=0 22ms=0 23ms=0 24ms=0 25ms=0 26ms=0 27ms=0 28ms=0 29ms=0 30ms=0 31ms=0 32ms=0 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"案例三：Hardware Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例三：Hardware Layer + 不动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_NONE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h2><p>截图中出现初始 drawLayer，后续展示的帧为绿色。它支持检查缓存复用的方向，不能证明所有设备上的性能或完整输入延迟。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/Hardware_Layer.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 0/31（0.00%），99th percentile 为 14 ms，High input latency 为 0。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 31</span><br><span>Janky frames: 0 (0.00%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 7ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 9ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 12ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 14ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 0</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=3 6ms=2 7ms=15 8ms=7 9ms=2 10ms=0 11ms=0 12ms=1 13ms=0 14ms=1 15ms=0 16ms=0 17ms=0 18ms=0 19ms=0 20ms=0 21ms=0 22ms=0 23ms=0 24ms=0 25ms=0 26ms=0 27ms=0 28ms=0 29ms=0 30ms=0 31ms=0 32ms=0 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"案例四：Normal Layer + 动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例四：Normal Layer + 动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        i = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setText(String.format(<span>&quot;%s%d&quot;</span>, animationText.getText().toString(), i));</span><br><span>        i ++ ;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h3><p>动态追加文本时，Animation、measure、layout、draw 中有较长片段，需要区分文本更新开销、布局和调度等待。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/Normal_Layer_UpdateView.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 12/31（38.71%），99th percentile 为 29 ms，High input latency 为 31。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 31</span><br><span>Janky frames: 12 (38.71%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 14ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 25ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 29ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 29ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 31</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 0</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=0 6ms=0 7ms=1 8ms=2 9ms=4 10ms=1 11ms=1 12ms=4 13ms=2 14ms=1 15ms=2 16ms=2 17ms=1 18ms=2 19ms=0 20ms=2 21ms=1 22ms=0 23ms=0 24ms=1 25ms=1 26ms=1 27ms=0 28ms=0 29ms=2 30ms=0 31ms=0 32ms=0 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"案例五：Software Layer + 动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例五：Software Layer + 动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_SOFTWARE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_NONE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>        i = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setText(String.format(<span>&quot;%s%d&quot;</span>, animationText.getText().toString(), i));</span><br><span>        i ++ ;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h3><p>截图中反复出现 buildDrawingCache，说明软件缓存需要重绘；仅凭它不能断言每帧都销毁 Bitmap，也不能把所有耗时归到一个瓶颈。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/Software_Layer_UpdateView.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 12/29（41.38%），99th percentile 为 32 ms，High input latency 为 18。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 29</span><br><span>Janky frames: 12 (41.38%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 14ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 30ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 31ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 32ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 18</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 4</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 4</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=0 6ms=1 7ms=0 8ms=0 9ms=0 10ms=1 11ms=6 12ms=3 13ms=2 14ms=3 15ms=0 16ms=1 17ms=1 18ms=1 19ms=2 20ms=0 21ms=1 22ms=0 23ms=0 24ms=2 25ms=1 26ms=0 27ms=1 28ms=0 29ms=0 30ms=1 31ms=1 32ms=1 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"案例六：Hardware Layer + 动态更新 View 内容\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>案例六：Hardware Layer + 动态更新 View 内容</h2><h3><a title=\"代码\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码</h3><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>objectAnimator1.addListener(<span>new</span> <span>android</span>.animation.AnimatorListenerAdapter() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationStart</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_HARDWARE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationEnd</span><span>(Animator animator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setLayerType(View.LAYER_TYPE_NONE,<span>null</span>);</span><br><span>        i = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br><span></span><br><span>objectAnimator1.addUpdateListener(<span>new</span> <span>ValueAnimator</span>.AnimatorUpdateListener() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onAnimationUpdate</span><span>(ValueAnimator valueAnimator)</span> {</span><br><span>        animationText.setText(String.format(<span>&quot;%s%d&quot;</span>, animationText.getText().toString(), i));</span><br><span>        i ++ ;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>});</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3><a title=\"Systrace 现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 现象</h3><p>截图中反复出现 drawLayer；文本增长还会改变内容尺寸，图中 layer 尺寸与静态案例不同。尺寸变化可能要求重新分配，但这些 slice 不能证明每一帧都重新分配 buffer。 <a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/Android_HardwareLayer_Example/blob/0060782a6c32337641acc14af3f9b4e8818402a3/Systrace/HardWare_Layer_UpdateView.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下载历史 Trace</a></p><p><img></p><h3><a title=\"gfxInfo 数据\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>gfxInfo 数据</h3><p>保留的日志记录 janky frames 为 14/30（46.67%），99th percentile 为 32 ms，High input latency 为 30。这是当次样本统计，不能据此判断主线程 CPU 负载。 <strong>这一整段与案例一完全重复，包括直方图。无法确认独立来源，不能用它做定量对照。</strong></p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Total frames rendered: 30</span><br><span>Janky frames: 14 (46.67%)</span><br><span>50th percentile: 16ms</span><br><span>90th percentile: 29ms</span><br><span>95th percentile: 32ms</span><br><span>99th percentile: 32ms</span><br><span>Number Missed Vsync: 0</span><br><span>Number High input latency: 30</span><br><span>Number Slow UI thread: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow bitmap uploads: 0</span><br><span>Number Slow issue draw commands: 0</span><br><span>Number Frame deadline missed: 0</span><br><span>HISTOGRAM: 5ms=0 6ms=0 7ms=0 8ms=0 9ms=0 10ms=2 11ms=2 12ms=5 13ms=1 14ms=2 15ms=1 16ms=3 17ms=2 18ms=0 19ms=0 20ms=0 21ms=1 22ms=1 23ms=1 24ms=1 25ms=2 26ms=2 27ms=0 28ms=1 29ms=1 30ms=0 31ms=0 32ms=2 34ms=0 36ms=0 38ms=0 40ms=0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"总结\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>总结</h2><p>六个案例保留了“内容稳定时缓存可能有用、内容变化时缓存需要更新”的观察方向，但不足以支持原来的固定性能排序。样本很小，案例一与六数据重复，动态文本还改变了工作量。</p><ol><li>稳定且绘制复杂的 View，可比较临时 Hardware Layer 与 NONE 的帧时序、内存和 GPU 开销。</li><li>动态内容场景，先查为何失效、尺寸是否变化，再看 layer 的额外离屏成本，不预设 NONE 或某一种 layer 必胜。</li><li>重复 buildDrawingCache/drawLayer 是调查线索，不是“每帧重新分配”的证据，也不能单凭它归因系统或厂商。</li><li>新设备要固定版本、刷新率、初始状态和重复次数。Android 12（API 31）起还可结合 <a href=\"https://perfetto.dev/docs/data-sources/frametimeline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Perfetto FrameTimeline</a> 观察 expected/actual frame；需要采到对应数据，缺失不代表没有卡顿。</li></ol><p>现代实现可继续对照 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/View.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 16 View</a>、<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/libs/hwui/RenderNode.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RenderNode</a>、<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/libs/hwui/pipeline/skia/SkiaPipeline.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SkiaPipeline</a> 与 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/ViewPropertyAnimator.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ViewPropertyAnimator</a>；源码标签用于说明实现边界，不代表本次在 Android 16 设备复现了旧实验。</p><p>既然读完了,如果有什么想法可以留言沟通,也可以扫文章下面的微信二维码加好友一起讨论;如有疏漏或者错误的地方,辛苦大家告知一下,我尽早更新以免误导他人;如果觉得有用,也请把这篇文章分享给其他人.</p><h1><a title=\"本文知乎地址\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>本文知乎地址</h1><p>由于博客留言交流不方便，点赞或者交流，可以移步本文的知乎界面<br><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/75458539\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">知乎 - Android 中的 Hardware Layer 详解</a></p><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客